+/*
+ * U880 (SM7675 "Cliffs", DPU 10.1): derived from the SM8650 (10.0) catalog. The stock Cliffs SDE description (offsets relative to the MDSS base)
+ * equals the SM8650 map shifted by the 0x1000 MDSS->MDP offset, trimmed to: 4 CTL, 4 LM, 3 DSPP, 2 VIG + 5 DMA, 4 PP (+CWB PPs),
+ * 4 merge_3d, 3 DSC engines (0x80000 x2, 0x81000), 1 WB, 4 INTF (DP, DSI, DSI, DP). Interrupt indices are SM8650's (unverified on 10.1).
